  "Id": 2343,
  "Title": " AKU-ISMC's Jonas Otterbeck and Sanaa Alimia Celebrate World Music Day ",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Watch the film of Prof Jonas Otterbeck and Dr Sanaa Alimia",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass6C15B8BC2803425D9C6D965A75ADF665\"><p></p><p>Watch the film of AKU-ISMC's Jonas Otterbeck and Sanaa Alimia in a celebration of&#160; World Music Day on June 21.&#160;The duo discuss <a href=\"https&#58;//www.youtube.com/watch?v=KsCcM0CTR0o&amp;t=1892s\" target=\"_blank\">Muslim Global Pop Stars&#58; a Discussion of a New Phenomenon</a>&#160;culminating in a special concert by master musicians from the Aga Khan Music Initiative.<br></p></div>",
